==Battleground==
*10 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
When you start, send out some meatshields with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cats]], which will help deal damage and tank the J.K. Bun Bun, respectively. If you need it, [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] can help to slow the J.K. Bun Bun. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and recently added [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] helps to speed up beating this stage so that you can get your [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score rewards]] easier.

